      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Consolidated Results",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Our consolidated gross margin percentage increased to 85% for the third quarter of 2026 from 74% for the second quarter of 2026 as a result of improvements in margins for both DRAM and NAND products.",
